{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06600","headline":"尚书省受誓诫贻太庙裴丞 · 储光羲","name":"尚书省受誓诫贻太庙裴丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皇家有恒宪，斋祭崇明祀。\n严车伊洛间，受誓文昌里。\n沈沈云阁见，稍稍城乌起。\n曙色照衣冠，虚庭鸣劒履。\n裴回念私觌，怅望临清汜。\n点翰欲何言，相思从此始。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}